/forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1055361-revival-of-the-exalted-travel-times-map?p=1342538#post1342538\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Alright.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ani81bke06r9paf/traveltime.html?dl=1\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>'s my copy.<br /> <br /> It's a plain html and javascript, without any outside dependency. Just open a copy on any modern browser, mobile or desktop.<br /> <br /> You can change the scale from Km to Miles and set your essence with a right click (hold click on mobile)</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually didn't think of embedding the image in the html, good idea! I'll update my link to fit in a single file.<br /> <br /> small bug report for your map - when displayed in miles, the label for &quot;merchant ship&quot; becomes &quot;merchant ship, false&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T10:22:05-07:00","id":1342551,"title":"","content":"It's hellish to edit with a context-sensitive IDE though <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I have a separate file with the blob and remove it to work.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>E